    "headline_insight": {
      "as_of": "2026-06-26T02:55:31.175321+00:00",
      "insight": "The runaway top story—Do Kwon transacting from prison while authorities took 72 days to seize credentials—reveals that readers track crypto payments not as a fintech convenience story but as a sovereignty test: which actors can still transact when institutions try to stop them, and which institutions are racing to capture those rails before they lose control.",
