        {
          "dimension": "Regulatory",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Fragmented licensing—Gemini pursuing Singapore MAS approval, Alchemy Pay securing a US money transmitter license, Buenos Aires writing new crypto payment rules—means operators face multi-jurisdictional compliance stacks with no harmonized global standard.",
